      "body": "## Scope\n- Add a responsive Persian and English public website for Kimia Beauty.\n- Load salon profile, verified contact details, and visible service catalog from `web/content/site.json`.\n- Keep unverified contact details and services empty; no simulated booking or login.\n- Add a dependency-free local preview server (`node web/server.mjs`).\n\n## Direction\nThis is the manually operated launch path. Later, owner onboarding can supply the same Business profile and Service Catalog fields through SmartCore APIs. Identity, Business, and Service remain their respective sources of truth.\n\n## Validation\n- JavaScript syntax checked with Node.\n- JSON parsed successfully.\n- Local preview served HTML, CSS, JS, and JSON with HTTP 200.\n\n## Before public launch\nConfirm branding, contact details, address, service names, durations, prices, and language copy with the salon owner.",
